2000] for agent-based vehicle dynamics (Sec. 4);
- Differentiable conversion between deterministic and probabilistic instantiation of two traffic models (Sec. 5);
- Application of the first differentiable hybrid traffic simulation framework to traffic control (Sec. 6).
